### Chess Tournament API - HTTP Requests Collection
### Compatible with REST Client for VS Code / IntelliJ / Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminUsername = admin
@adminPassword = password123

###
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
###

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store Auth Token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

###
### 2. PLAYERS
###

# 2.1 List all players
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players

### 2.2 Search players by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players?q=Magnus

### 2.3 Create a new player (Protected - requires JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Levon Aronian",
  "email": "levon.aronian@example.com",
  "country": "USA",
  "date_of_birth": "1982-10-06",
  "current_rating": 2729
}

### 2.4 Get player by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/1

### 2.5 Update player by ID (Protected - requires JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/players/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "country": "Norway"
}

### 2.6 Attempt to edit player rating directly (Fails with 400 - ratings change ONLY via record_result)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/players/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_rating": 2900
}

### 2.7 Get player analytics (performance, progression, tournament history)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/1/analytics


###
### 3. TOURNAMENTS
###

# 3.1 List all tournaments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments

### 3.2 Create tournament (Protected - requires JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reykjavik Open 2026",
  "format": "SWISS",
  "start_date": "2026-05-01",
  "end_date": "2026-05-10",
  "status": "UPCOMING"
}

### 3.3 Get tournament by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1

### 3.4 Update tournament / Change status (Protected - requires JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ONGOING"
}

### 3.5 Register player for tournament (Protected - requires JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/2/register
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player_id": 1
}

### 3.6 Get all registrations for tournament
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/registrations

### 3.7 Create a new tournament round (Auto-increments round_no, Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.8 Get all rounds for tournament
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/rounds

### 3.9 Get tournament standings (from v_leaderboard)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/standings

### 3.10 Get tournament analytics (total games, outcomes, upsets, rating changes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/analytics

### 3.11 Get tournament predictions (Public - from prediction table joined with player)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/predictions


###
### 4. ROUNDS & GAMES
###

# 4.1 Create game in round (Protected - requires JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rounds/2/games
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "board_no": 5,
  "white_player_id": 1,
  "black_player_id": 3
}

### 4.2 Get all games for round
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rounds/1/games

### 4.3 Record game result (Protected - calls CALL record_result(?, ?))
# Outcome must be WHITE, BLACK, or DRAW
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games/1/result
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "WHITE"
}


###
### 5. DASHBOARD
###

# 5.1 Dashboard Analytics (Top 10 players, outcomes, upsets, top 5 rating progression)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard


###
### 6. ERROR MAPPING DEMONSTRATIONS
###

### 6.1 MySQL 1062 -> 409 Conflict (Generic: "Duplicate entry")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/register
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player_id": 1
}

### 6.2 MySQL 1452 -> 409 Conflict (Generic: "Referenced record does not exist")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1/register
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player_id": 999999
}

### 6.3 MySQL 3819 -> 400 Bad Request (Check Constraint)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "end_date": "2020-01-01"
}

### 6.4 MySQL 1644 -> 400 Bad Request with custom signal message (Result already recorded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games/1/result
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "WHITE"
}

### 6.5 Direct Rating Edit Rejected -> 400 Bad Request ("Rating cannot be edited directly")
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/players/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_rating": 3000
}

### 6.5 Zod Validation Error -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

### 6.6 Unauthorized -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacker",
  "email": "hacker@example.com"
}
